Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Prolog}
Comment: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:07.15,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Partea A}
Comment: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:31.52,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Partea B}
Comment: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:54.06,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Comment: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:24.03,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Epilog}
Comment: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:15.03,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.69,0:00:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am auzit că Akatsuki Kojou \Nși Vatler s-au mai luptat aici,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci m-am gândit că \Nlucrurile vor fi mai haotice.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.45,0:00:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă avem apă și curent electric.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e o ușurare.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.75,0:00:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ce a fost chestia de mai devreme?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.79,0:00:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cea care a scufundat crucișătorul \Npe care ne aflam, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.63,0:00:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil tot ea e responsabilă și de dezastrele recente din această regiune maritimă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kisaki Kiriha.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.43,0:00:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-e teamă că nu ne permitem să nu investigăm Sicriul Oceanic II.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.35,0:00:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu m-aș fi așteptat să fim prinși într-un taifun, \Niar crucișătorul Conglomeratului Yaze să fie așa de fragil.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.44,0:00:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci vrei să spui că nava nu s-a scufundat pentru că voi v-ați dezlănțuit?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.49,0:00:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asta m-am opus acestei colaborări.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.37,0:00:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce trebuie ca Organizația Regele Leu și Biroul Taishi să investigheze împreună?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.54,0:00:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.58,0:01:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din patrea noastră, nu e nevoie ca tu să fii aici dacă este și al IV-lea Străbun.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că el pe unde umblă?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.71,0:01:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spus că avea ceva de făcut.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.67,0:01:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am stabilit că ne vom întâlni mai pe seară.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.47,0:01:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar pe o asemenea \Nvreme nu prea e posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are ceva important de făcut?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine... da, pentru el.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.39,0:01:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce anume?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lecții suplimentare... de înot.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.81,0:01:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, vai...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.44,0:01:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akatsuki! Akatsuki, trezește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.57,0:01:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeragi! De ce ești îmbrăcată astfel?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și eu aș vrea să știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa eram îmbrăcată când m-am trezit.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.04,0:01:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar noi dormeam aici împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.96,0:01:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Împreună?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.63,0:01:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akatsuki, ce ne facem acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.93,0:01:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că mi-am pierdut \Nceva foarte important.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.93,0:01:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceva foarte important?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai puțin, Himeragi. Eu nu-mi amintesc să se fi întâmpla așa ceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lupul Viscolului nu e aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.90,0:02:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adevărat, cutia de chitară pe care o porți mereu lipsește.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.16,0:02:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi trebuit să o aduc ieri.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și asta e uniforma ta de sport,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar genul ăsta de pantalonași ar fi trebuit să dispară demult.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E de la Organizația Regele Leu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.17,0:02:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.58,0:02:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, ce îți imaginezi că este Organizația Regele Leu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, ce făceam noi într-un loc ca ăsta?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.01,0:02:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta și faptul că am dormit amândoi împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.43,0:02:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta... așteaptă, nu-mi amintesc nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.93,0:02:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai mult, ar fi trebuit să fie zi liberă de la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.44,0:02:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci de ce suntem încă la școală?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba, nimic nu are sens.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.57,0:02:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Himeragi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta... e sânge!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci asta înseamnă...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.08,0:03:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cineva a fost lovit cu chestia asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba, e pe bune asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, ce e?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, îmi căutam batista. Dar e ceva umflat în buzunarul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu... nu! Nu e al meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și sutienul ăsta e uriaș.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu poate fi al lui Himeragi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui!?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.28,0:03:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu siguranță nu e al meu, dar pare cunoscut.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar putea fi al Sayaka-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.49,0:03:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e, mirosul ăsta, parcă l-am mai simțit.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.21,0:03:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă, voiam doar să verific... Ahh!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creezi o diversiune?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.50,0:03:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu! Am văzut o siluetă pe acoperișul clădirii din față.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astea sunt cearșafurile de la infirmerie?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, asta e uniforma mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e costumul de baie al lui Asagi.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.53,0:04:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci ți-ai dat seama după miros.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu! Numele ei e scris aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.24,0:04:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, îmi amintesc silueta lui Asagi în costumul ăsta.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.41,0:04:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum îmi amintesc. Eu și Asagi făceam lecții suplimentare de înot.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că am venit la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vânt nerușinat!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.81,0:04:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asta ți-am spus că nu trebuia să vii.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.31,0:04:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicio șansă. Eu sunt observatoarea lui Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.11,0:04:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce observi exact? Sunt doar lecții suplimentare de înot.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau, chiar ești aici, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.07,0:05:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi, de ce ești aici? Azi nu e școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.08,0:05:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, am și eu lecții suplimentare azi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu voiam să-mi ud bretonul, așa că am chiulit, dar am fost prinsă.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci e vina ta. Ghinion pentru mine. Nu am rezistență.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fără rezistență?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampirii nu se descurcă cu apa, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E doar o superstiție.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.26,0:05:27.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu știai să înoți nici înainte să devii vampir.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ehh, e adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.31,0:05:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar că nu sunt prea bun la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și Asagi, grăbește-te și schimbă-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e nevoie.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Port costumul de baie dedesubt. Vezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești o fetiță de școală primară?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e mai eficient să simplificăm lucrurile?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Întotdeauna e cineva care uită să aducă lenjerie de schimb.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.83,0:05:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce spui? De ce aș...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.92,0:05:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.88,0:06:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici vorbă să uit hahahaha.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.47,0:06:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plouă tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.30,0:06:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oftat. Se pare că nu se va opri.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.47,0:06:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un uragan.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să continue să plouă o vreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.90,0:06:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai venit să o ajuți pe Natsuki-chan?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpâna nu e acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.03,0:06:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am venit să transmit mesajul domnișoarei Sasasaki.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Profesoara Sasasaki?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.25,0:06:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uraganul nr. 31 se apropie de Insula Itogami. Lecția suplimentară de azi este suspendată.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.13,0:06:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asemenea, monorailul s-a oprit acum cinci minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.85,0:06:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum îmi amintesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.35,0:06:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte-san a primit permisiunea pentru ca noi să folosim clădirea școlii.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.64,0:06:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteptam uraganul înăuntrul școlii.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.69,0:06:59.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ko... Kojou!?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tocmai la timp, am ceva să te întreb.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e, Asagi?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce... ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.91,0:07:09.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fața ta e super roșie.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.91,0:07:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu... nimic!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci ieri...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh, uită asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.29,0:07:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă ne spui să uităm, noi nu ne amintim nimic oricum.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.71,0:07:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, serios? Minunat.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.01,0:07:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar uită! Să nu-ți amintești nimic! Uită totul!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.39,0:07:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e cu Asagi aia?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce s-a panicat?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, acolo e aproape de sala de gospodărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.53,0:07:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai să mergem să vedem.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interiorul navei e uriaș.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.58,0:07:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Într-adevăr. Nu e prea mult sens să ai o navă așa mare doar pentru câțiva pasageri.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ascunde?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.88,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O cușcă?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pochi?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.97,0:08:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e chestia asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-e teamă că e un fel de artefact magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.94,0:08:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Devine din ce în ce mai suspect.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Nagisa, hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă, Senpai, e un bilet.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uită-te acolo, e un mesaj de moarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că încearcă să scrie Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai puțin, sunt nevinovat!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai e ceva scris aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.97,0:08:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că spune „bine ai venit acasă”. Poate e un fel de cod?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, e Kojou-kun și Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.81,0:09:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa, ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e cu sângele?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sânge?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! S-a vărsat ketchupul!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ketchup?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.49,0:09:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e, aseară am mâncat toți împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cina de ieri?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.45,0:09:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca să evităm ploaia, am venit de la piscină la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.16,0:09:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apoi acolo...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e! Ne-am întâlnit cu Nagisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ghinion teribil.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.47,0:09:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voiam să mă antrenez singură, dar ploua prea tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am fugit spre stația de monorail, dar serviciul s-a oprit chiar în fața mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hainele mi s-au udat, așa că a trebuit să mă schimb.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.65,0:09:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că nu putem pleca azi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-avem ce face, ne pregătim să stăm la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.15,0:09:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pentru noi trei fete, putem dormi în paturile din infirmerie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar eu?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți merge la sala de sport și să găsești o saltea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ale alea miros îngrozitor!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o problemă mică.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.16,0:10:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comparativ, există o problemă mult mai urgentă.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Problema este... ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cina noastră!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.13,0:10:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios? Mulțumesc. Atunci mergem înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cei de la clubul de grădinărit și-au contactat președintele.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.18,0:10:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A zis că oricum uraganul va distruge tot,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că putem lua câte legume vrem din grădină.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.19,0:10:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar e ciudat să culegi legume pe vremea asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piatră, hârtie, foarfecă!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.86,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne, am crezut că o să mor în furtună.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumim pentru efort, Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat cu tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A alunecat și a căzut. Și-a pierdut echilibrul în noroi.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am fost neatentă.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa o să răcești. Ai haine de schimb?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte, ai apărut din nou de nicăieri.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.72,0:11:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am primit permisiunea să folosesc hainele stăpânei. Vă rog, purtați asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.85,0:11:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă o secundă. Asta e...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.15,0:11:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar chiar vei răci așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.53,0:11:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, renunț. Mă schimb.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.99,0:11:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce ar avea Natsuki-chan pantalonași de sport?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta nu e important!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan, ai văzut Sekkarou-ul meu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.08,0:11:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă era aici când pregăteam cina.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.09,0:11:34.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate s-a întâmplat ceva după aceea?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.63,0:11:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici tu nu-ți amintești?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.38,0:11:40.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi amintesc doar că eram fericită că aveam ceva de mâncare.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău, Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă. E responsabilitatea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji. Îl vom găsi cu siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.10,0:11:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.98,0:11:51.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă de uniforma ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pata aia s-ar putea să nu iasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.23,0:11:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e! Scuze, Kojou-kun, Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă duc să o spăl.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.15,0:12:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, hai să vorbim despre unde mergem mai departe.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeragi, ai auzit asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.96,0:12:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Venea de acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău! Iartă-mă pentru greșeala mea, Yukina!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.97,0:12:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayaka, moartea ta nu va fi în zadar.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lasă totul în seama mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayaka-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Folia!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce sunteți voi două aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, hai să ne întoarcem pe punte.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aerul de aici de jos e înăbușitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Om al mării? De ce ai apărut aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.50,0:12:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai pierdut niște ingrediente magice
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și te vei sinucide ritualic ca ispășire?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e chiar atât de simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.97,0:13:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este un produs important comandat de guvernul japonez din Regatul Aldegyr.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa a venit în Japonia pentru asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.65,0:13:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e un motiv suficient ca să mori.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Folia.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi trebuit să o oprești.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.44,0:13:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar e o ocazie rară să vezi un seppuku japonez autentic. Ar fi păcat să-l opresc.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magia de înviere e pregătită.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta nu e problema!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.33,0:13:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apropo, Sayaka-san, ingredientul magic pierdut este...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amanita Phalloides (Pălăria Morții).
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.29,0:13:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar numele sună ca o ciupercă sinistră.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, nu e otrăvitoare sau adictivă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă o mănânci din greșeală,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.43,0:13:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,intri într-o transă și simți euforie și bucurie.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci, cu alte cuvinte, doar să nu o mănânci, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.93,0:13:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate fi și ingredient pentru anestezice și seruri ale adevărului.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.52,0:13:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, îmi amintesc acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.23,0:14:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum că zici, am pus niște ciuperci în oala de ieri.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.95,0:14:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu m-aș fi gândit că veți veni toți la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.25,0:14:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu nici n-am vrut să vin.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa a insistat.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.09,0:14:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voiam să-mi văd logodnicul într-un cadru obișnuit, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe cine numești logodnic?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.76,0:14:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vorbi așa tare când mâncăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.14,0:14:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se va arde.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toată lumea, pregătiți bețișoarele.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.93,0:14:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yukina-chan, ciuperca asta e gata.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte-san, gustă una.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accept.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau. E grozavă.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios? Slavă cerului.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Per total, parcă gustul nu e destul de puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din fericire avem ciupercile astea delicioase.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E uimitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.04,0:14:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În afară de grădina de legume, mai e un loc unde cresc ciuperci.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.37,0:14:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alt loc?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt astea cele culese de Kojou și ceilalți?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceste ciuperci erau deja în bucătărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.80,0:15:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E delicioasă, deci ce contează?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.35,0:15:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ultimele udon au fost și ele minunate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum chiar pare o oală fierbinte adevărată.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.35,0:15:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu s-a terminat, Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.73,0:15:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am folosit ingredientele rămase pentru omlete!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.19,0:15:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou-kun, hai, spune ahhh.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt deja plin!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce te înroșești?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am făcut baie împreună înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Baie?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost când eram în școala primară.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.42,0:15:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of, Senpai chiar e un pervertit.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, du-te și stai acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.30,0:15:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt deja așezat.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.67,0:15:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, trebuie să-mi fac datoria de observator.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar tot timpul interacționezi cu alte fete.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-ai făcut atâtea lucruri indecente.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.89,0:15:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vrei să le faci, fă-le doar mie.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei Kirasaka, Himeragi se poartă ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.86,0:16:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grăbește-te și ajută-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kirasaka, tu!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E din cauza căldurii din cameră.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De curând sutienul meu a devenit foarte strâmt.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-am vrut să aud asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.16,0:16:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știam eu. Nu-ți plac fetele mari.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.50,0:16:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai plânge! Nu te apleca! La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, La Folia, ajută-mă cu Kirasaka.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alege, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.68,0:16:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Într-o situație ca asta, am auzit că în Japonia se joacă Jocul Regelui.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.97,0:16:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde ai învățat prostiile astea?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, nu ești tu regalitate?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.94,0:16:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu. Eu sunt regele, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În cazul ăsta, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog semnează aici, pe certificatul de căsătorie.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Povara jocului ăsta e prea mare!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.61,0:16:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, deci chiar urăști fetele grele!?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.03,0:16:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, nesimțitule!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.62,0:16:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Semnează! Pentru viitorul Insulei Itogami și al Regatului Aldegyr.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, spune ahhh.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă în pace!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce nenoroc!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ești afectat?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am o rezistență ridicată la stări anormale.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.31,0:17:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Corpul meu e astfel încât chiar dacă mănânc nu mă îngraș.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.31,0:17:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar din când în când, ceva de genul ăsta e bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.86,0:17:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa e?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui? Nu ești mulțumit după ce mi-ai văzut costumul de baie?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E doar costumul școlii.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.37,0:17:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum că mă gândesc, vântul de azi e intens, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Școala noastră va fi distrusă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.30,0:17:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi, chiloții tăi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai uitat să porți unii?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nuu!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E periculos!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.97,0:17:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde ai scos aia? Bățul ăla de baseball metalic?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.39,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hard drive-ul unui computer își pierde datele dacă e lovit puternic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.31,0:18:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci și Kojou ar trebui.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă, Asagi, n-am făcut nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.44,0:18:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hipocampul e o parte a creierului aflată pe lateral.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E partea responsabilă de memorie și învățare.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.99,0:18:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum înțelegi, Kojou!?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, îmi amintesc acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și eu îmi amintesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci asta s-a întâmplat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.84,0:18:35.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceea ce am mâncat era Amanita Phalloides.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lăsați-mă să mor!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.64,0:18:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Raport de situație.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.27,0:18:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Raport?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.44,0:18:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colecția stăpânei conține Amanita Phalloides.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pentru că e bogată, e dispusă să împartă cu voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.98,0:18:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.03,0:18:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Minunat. Sayaka. Se pare că nu trebuie să te sinucizi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:58.37,0:19:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, da, în sfârșit s-a rezolvat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, Himeragi, n-am...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine e? Într-un moment ca ăsta...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.63,0:19:11.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, grozav, am reușit să te contactez.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.13,0:19:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino repede. E o mare problemă!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaze, ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un Kraken. Și o armată de oameni ai mării.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.97,0:19:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă rezistăm, dar dacă continuă, vom muri.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trimite întăriri, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rezistați până ajungem.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În investigația Oceanus Grave II Yaze a întâmpinat probleme.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să mergem rapid acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.78,0:19:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, asta e uniforma mea?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.95,0:19:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte-san m-a ajutat să o spăl?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afirmativ. Recuperată după ce s-a uscat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.50,0:19:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asemenea, bara de rufe nu mai e necesară. Recomand să fie recuperată de pe acoperiș.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bară de rufe?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.46,0:19:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deoarece nu erau suficiente, după ce am avut consimțământul tău, am folosit-o.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci spui că...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.26,0:20:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar asta ți-a dat Himeragi să folosești?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.97,0:20:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afirmativ.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.77,0:20:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum că zici, când mâncam oala fierbinte
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,am discutat ceva de genul ăsta.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeragi...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yukina...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.15,0:20:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu... nu! Nu e vina mea, e vina ciupercii.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.37,0:20:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am rezolvat misterul în sfârșit.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.95,0:20:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, după toată activitatea asta cerebrală...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.71,0:20:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numele de pe cușcă, Pochi, nu se referă la chestia asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Ardeal are niște fetișuri ciudate.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuiri!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci oamenii mării și Krakenul nu sunt de aceeași parte?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba, nu se mai termină.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.73,0:20:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino, Regulus Aurum!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.86,0:20:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În spatele tău!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc, Natsuki-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți spune profesoarei „chan”, idiotule.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.29,0:21:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios, mă tratezi ca pe o curieră.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e o favoare mică.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.59,0:21:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, am întârziat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu glumi, ați avut probleme?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.68,0:21:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uhh, ce s-a întâmplat, Himeragi?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.81,0:21:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, măcar am ajuns la timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lasă restul în seama mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.73,0:21:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E lupta mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.19,0:21:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, Senpai, e lupta noastră!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.61,0:21:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu, Șamanul Sabiei al Zeului Suprem și preoteasă a Leului, te implor.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.95,0:21:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lumină a zorilor exorcizării, lup spiritual al ceții de zăpadă, dă-mi puterea ta divină a oțelului,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ca să pot nimici o sută de spirite rele!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino, Sadalmelik-Albus!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.68,0:22:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chestia asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.89,0:22:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă, Kujou-kun, oprește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.19,0:22:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.19,0:22:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un artefact magic nou-nouț.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.32,0:22:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un artefact magic lăsat de Vatler.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-e teamă că și Krakenul acesta la fel.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.40,0:22:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci asta e, protejezi artefactul ăsta magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:30.29,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, toată lumea,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.75,0:22:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,copilul ăsta e atât de mic acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Putem, te rog, să-i cruțăm viața?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.01,0:22:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oprește-te, Sadalmelik-Albus, e destul.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.32,0:24:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Slavă cerului.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:28.70,0:24:31.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, nu vreau să păstrez artefactul acela.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:32.16,0:24:35.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să-l dau Organizației Regele Leu sau Taishikyoku e la fel de enervant.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.00,0:24:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ce e cu oamenii mării aceia?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.09,0:24:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze, Lei-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.05,0:24:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Echipa oamenilor mării a fost înfrântă. N-am reușit să recuperăm artefactul magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:52.01,0:24:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Păcat.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.01,0:24:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acela era Moștenirea Zeilor Vechi a lui Dimitrie Vatler.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.23,0:25:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă l-am fi obținut, ar fi fost util la un moment dat
Dialogue: 99,0:25:03.94,0:25:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,pentru planurile noastre ce urmează să înceapă.
