Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.69,0:00:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that Akatsuki Kojou and Vatler fought here before.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I thought the situation here would be more chaotic.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.45,0:00:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The electrical and water equipment are still functional.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.75,0:00:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, that thing just now...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.79,0:00:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing who sank the cruiser we were on?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.63,0:00:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That thing is probably the reason for the recent disasters in this sea region.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kisaki Kiriha.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.43,0:00:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that is why we cannot afford to not investigate the Oceanus Grave II.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think we would encounter a hurricane,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.94,0:00:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the Yaze Conglomerate's cruiser would be so fragile.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is beyond my expectation.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.44,0:00:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you are saying the ship didn't sink because you three were making a ruckus?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.49,0:00:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is why I was strongly opposed to this.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.37,0:00:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why does the Lion King Organization have to cooperate with the Taishikyoku in this investigation?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.54,0:00:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.58,0:01:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For our side, as long the Fourth Progenitor is here, there is no reason for you to be.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that man doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.71,0:01:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he had something else to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.67,0:01:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We agreed that he will come later tonight.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.47,0:01:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in this weather it's probably not possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has something important to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uhh... to him it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.39,0:01:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Supplementary... swimming lessons.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.81,0:01:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.44,0:01:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, wake up, Senpai!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.57,0:01:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himera...gi! Why are you in that outfit?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one that wanted to ask.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was like this when I opened my eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.04,0:01:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sleeping in the same futon with Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.96,0:01:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sleeping together?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.63,0:01:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.93,0:01:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like I lost something precious.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.93,0:01:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something precious...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Himeragi, I don't recall that at all...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sekkarou... isn't here!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.90,0:02:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true, the guitar case you always carry is missing.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.16,0:02:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have brought it over yesterday.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's your P.E. uniform,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that type of bloomer should be long extinct.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it the Lion King Organization's?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.17,0:02:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.58,0:02:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, what do you imagine the Lion King Organization to be?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, what were we doing in this kind of place?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.01,0:02:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That and the two of us were sleeping together.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.43,0:02:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's, wait, I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.93,0:02:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moreover, it should be a day off from school.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.44,0:02:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are we still at the school?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, none of this makes sense.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.57,0:02:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Himeragi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This... is blood!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then this means...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.08,0:03:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,someone got whacked by this thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, is this for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, what is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I was looking for my handkerchief. But there's this bulgy thing inside my pocket.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... no! It's not mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also this bra is huge.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be Himeragi's.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean!?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.28,0:03:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's certainly not mine, but it looks familiar.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might be Sayaka-san's.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.49,0:03:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, this smell, I feel like I've smelled it before.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.21,0:03:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I just wanted to confirm... Ahh!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creating a distraction?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.50,0:03:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! I saw a shape on the roof of the building across from us.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are the infirmary's bedsheets?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, this is my uniform.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Asagi's swimsuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.53,0:04:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you figured it out through the smell.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Her name is written here!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.24,0:04:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I remember Asagi's figure in this swimsuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.41,0:04:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I remember. Asagi and I were taking supplementary swimming lessons.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we came to the school.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such a lewd wind!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.81,0:04:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I said you didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.31,0:04:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. I am Senpai's observer.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.11,0:04:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Observe what exactly? It's just supplementary swimming lessons.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really are here, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.07,0:05:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi, why are you here? There's no school today.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.08,0:05:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have supplementary lessons today as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want my bangs to get wet so I ditched class but got caught.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then this is your own fault. It sucks for me. I have no resistance.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No resistance?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampires can't deal with water, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just a superstition.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.26,0:05:27.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't know how to swim even before you became a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ehh, is that true?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.31,0:05:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just not that great at it.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Asagi hurry up and go change.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing my swimsuit underneath. See?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a elementary school kid?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it more efficient to cut corners?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is always someone who forgets to bring a change of underwear.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.83,0:05:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Why would I...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.92,0:05:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.88,0:06:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's no way I would forget hahahaha.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.47,0:06:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's coming down hard.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.30,0:06:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sigh. Looks like it's not going to stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.47,0:06:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a hurricane.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should keep raining for a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.90,0:06:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you here to help Natsuki-chan?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The master is away.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.03,0:06:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am here to deliver Miss Sasasaki's message.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sasasaki-sensei?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.25,0:06:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurricane #31 is approaching Itogami Island. Today's supplementary lesson is suspended.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.13,0:06:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, the monorail stopped running five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.85,0:06:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I remember.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.35,0:06:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte-san got permission for us to use the school building.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.64,0:06:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were waiting out the hurricane inside of the school.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.69,0:06:59.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ko... Kojou!?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing, I have something to ask you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Asagi?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh... what?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.91,0:07:09.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your face is super red.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.91,0:07:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... nothing!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So yesterday...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh, forget it!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.29,0:07:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you tell us to forget, we don't remember anything at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.71,0:07:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, really? That's great.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.01,0:07:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just forget it! Absolutely don't remember it! Forget all of it!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.39,0:07:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Asagi, what?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why was she panicking?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, that is near the Home Ec room.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.53,0:07:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The interior of the ship is huge.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.58,0:07:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Truely. There isn't much reason to have this huge ship just for some passengers.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it hiding?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.88,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cage?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pochi?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.97,0:08:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fear it is some kind of magical artefact.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.94,0:08:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is getting fishier and fishier.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagisa, hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Senpai, there's a note.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look there, it's a dying message.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like she's trying to write Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm innocent!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's more stuff written here.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.97,0:08:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like it is saying "welcome home". Maybe it is some kind of code?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Kojou-kun and Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.81,0:09:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa, are you alright?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with the blood?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! The ketchup spilled!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ketchup?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.49,0:09:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, last night we ate dinner with everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday's dinner?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yea, Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.45,0:09:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To avoid the rain, we came from the swimming pool to the school.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.16,0:09:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then there...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! We ran into Nagisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What terrible luck.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.47,0:09:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to train by myself but it was raining too hard.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ran to the monorail stop but the service stopped right in front of me.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My clothes were soaked so I had to change.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.65,0:09:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's no way back today.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't help it, we'll prepare to stay at the school.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.15,0:09:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For us three girls, we can sleep in the infirmary beds.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go to the gym and find a mat to sleep on.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those smell really terrible!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a small problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.16,0:10:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Compared to that there is a much more urgent problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The problem is... what?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our dinner!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.13,0:10:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks. Then we'll go ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The guys from the gardening club got a hold of their president.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.18,0:10:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said that the hurircane will wreck everything anyways,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we can have as much of the vegetable in the garden as we like.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.19,0:10:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's weird to be picking vegetables in this weather.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.86,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geez. I though I was going to die in the storm.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work, Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yukina-chan too.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She tripped and fell. Lost her footing in the mud.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold this way. Do you have a change of clothes?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte, you appeared out of nowhere again.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.72,0:11:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Received permission to use the master's clothes. Please wear this.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.85,0:11:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a second. That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.15,0:11:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you really will catch a cold like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.53,0:11:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yea, I give up. I'm changing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.99,0:11:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would Natsuki-chan have bloomers?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not important!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan, have you seen my Sekkarou?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.08,0:11:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was still here when we were making dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.09,0:11:34.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps something happened afterwards?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.63,0:11:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't remember either?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.38,0:11:40.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only remember being glad there was something to eat.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's alright. It's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll find it for sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.10,0:11:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.98,0:11:51.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of your uniform.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That stain might not come off.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.23,0:11:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! Sorry, Kojou-kun, Yukina-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go wash it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.15,0:12:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk about where we should go next.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeragi, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.96,0:12:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It came from over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Forgive me for my mistake, Yukina!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.97,0:12:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayaka, your death will not be in vain.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayaka-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Folia!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you two here?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyways, lets go back to the deck.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The air down here feels stale.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Merman? Why did you appear here?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.50,0:12:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lost some magical ingredients
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you'll commit ritual suicide to atone?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.97,0:13:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is an important product the Japanese government ordered from the Kingdom of Aldegyr.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The princess came to Japan for this.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.65,0:13:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not enough of a reason to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Folia.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should have stopped her.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.44,0:13:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's a rare opportunity to witness an authentic Japanese ritual suicide. It's a waste to stop it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resurrection magic has been prepared.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.33,0:13:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Sayaka-san, the lost magical ingredient is...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amanita Phalloides (Death Cap).
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.29,0:13:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hearing its name make it sound like some ominous mushroom.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually it isn't poisonous or addictive.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you eat it by accident,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.43,0:13:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll enter a trance, and feel excitement and joy.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So in other words, just don't eat it, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.93,0:13:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can also be an ingredient for anesthetics and truth serums.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.52,0:13:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember now!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.23,0:14:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, we put some mushrooms into yesterday's hot pot.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.95,0:14:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, I never thought that all of you would come to school as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.25,0:14:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't really want to come.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The princess insisted.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.09,0:14:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see my fiancee in a casual setting, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling fiancee?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.76,0:14:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't speak so loudly when we are eating dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.14,0:14:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's going to burn.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone get your chopsticks ready.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.93,0:14:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yukina-chan, this mushroom is done.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte-san, try one.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accept.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. It's great.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Overall, I feel like the flavour isn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luckily we got these delicious mushrooms.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's really amazing.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.04,0:14:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aside from the vegetable garden, there's also another place that grows mushrooms.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.37,0:14:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another place?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't these the ones that Kojou and everyone else picked?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These mushrooms were already in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.80,0:15:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's delicious, so who cares?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.35,0:15:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The last udon tasted great too.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now this feels like a real hot pot.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.35,0:15:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet, Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.73,0:15:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We used the leftover ingredient to make omelets!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.19,0:15:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou-kun, here, say ahhh.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm full already!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting embarassed?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We took a bath together before.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bath?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, you...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was when we were in elementary school.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.42,0:15:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Senpai really is a lewd person.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, go sit over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.30,0:15:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm already sitting down.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.67,0:15:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I have to do my job as an observer.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you always interact with other girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did so many indecent things to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.89,0:15:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to do it, then do it to only me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo Kirasaka, Himeragi is acting weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.86,0:16:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and help me.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kirasaka, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because this room is so hot.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Recently my bra became really tight.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear that!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.16,0:16:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You really don't like girls who are big.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.50,0:16:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop crying! Don't lean over! Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, La Folia, help me with Kirasaka.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Choose, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.68,0:16:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this situation, I heard that in Japan you should play the King's game.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.97,0:16:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn this crap?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyways, aren't you royalty?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.94,0:16:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm the king right?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, Kojou.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please sign here on this marriage certificate.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The burden of this game is too heavy!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.61,0:16:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, so you really hate the heavy girls!?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.03,0:16:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you jerk!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.62,0:16:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sign it! For the future of Itogami Island and the Kingdom of Aldegyr.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, say ahhh.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such misfortune.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not affected?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a high resistance to abnormal statuses.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.31,0:17:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body is such that even If I eat I wont get fat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.31,0:17:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But once in a while something like this is good.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.86,0:17:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Are you not satisfied after seeing my swimsuit?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just the school-issued swimsuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.37,0:17:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, today's wind is intense eh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our school will be wrecked.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.30,0:17:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asagi, your panties?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you forget to wear some?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.97,0:17:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that? That metal baseball bat?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.39,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A computer's harddrive will lose data after being stuck by a powerful force.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.31,0:18:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, Kojou should as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Asagi, I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.44,0:18:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Hippocampus is a part of the brain that's on the side.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the part of the brain responsible for memory and learning.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.99,0:18:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get it now, Kojou!?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember now.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.84,0:18:35.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing we ate was the Amanita Phalloides.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me die!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.64,0:18:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Situation report.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.27,0:18:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Astarte!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Report?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.44,0:18:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master's collection has Amanita Phalloides.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because she is wealthy, she is willing to share with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.98,0:18:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.03,0:18:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great. Sayaka. Looks like you wont have to commit ritual suicide.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:58.37,0:19:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yea, yea, it's finally settled.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Himeragi, we haven't...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it? At a time like this...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.63,0:19:11.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, great, I got through.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.13,0:19:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come quickly. There's a big problem!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaze, what happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a Kraken. There's also a Merman army.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.97,0:19:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're still holding on, but if this continues we're going to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do your best until we arrive.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In their investigation of the Oceanus Grave II Yaze ran into trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry over.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.78,0:19:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my uniform?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.95,0:19:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Astarte-san help me wash it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Affirmative. Retrieved it after it finished drying.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.50,0:19:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, the laundry pole is no longer necessary. Recommend that it be retrieved from the roof.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laundry pole?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.46,0:19:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since there were not enough laundry poles, after getting your consent, I used it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're saying...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.26,0:20:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this really what Himeragi gave you to use?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.97,0:20:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.77,0:20:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, when we were eating the hot pot
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we did discuss something like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeragi...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yukina...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.15,0:20:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... no! It's not my fault, it's the mushroom's fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.37,0:20:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We solved the mystery at last.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.95,0:20:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, after all this brain activity...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.71,0:20:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name on the cage, Pochi, can't be referring to this thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Ardeal has some weird fetishes.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuiri!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the Merman and the Kraken are not on the same side?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, there's no end to this.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.73,0:20:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come, Regulus Aurum!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.86,0:20:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Natsuki-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call your teacher chan, you moron.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.29,0:21:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, treating me like a courier delivery service.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't a small favour.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.59,0:21:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're late.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No kidding, did you run into some trouble?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.68,0:21:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uhh, what was it that happened, Himeragi?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.81,0:21:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, at least we got here in time.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.73,0:21:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.19,0:21:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Senpai, this is our fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.61,0:21:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Sword Shaman of the High God and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.95,0:21:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy mist, grant me the divine might of thy steel,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come, Sadalmelik-Albus!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.68,0:22:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This thing...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.89,0:22:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kujou-kun, stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.19,0:22:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.19,0:22:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A brand new magical artefact.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.32,0:22:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a magical artefact left behind by Vatler.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this Kraken is as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.40,0:22:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it, you are protecting this magical artefact.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:30.29,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou, everyone,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.75,0:22:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this child is so tiny now.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we please spare its life?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.01,0:22:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, Sadalmelik-Albus, that's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kojou-kun.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.32,0:24:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:28.70,0:24:31.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yea, I don't want to keep that magical artefact.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:32.16,0:24:35.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Giving it to the Lion King Organization or the Taishikyoku is also bothersome.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.00,0:24:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what's up with those Merman?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.09,0:24:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Lei-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.05,0:24:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Merman squad was defeated. We failed to recover the magical artefact.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:52.01,0:24:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.01,0:24:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was Dimitrie Vatler's Legacy of the Old Gods.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.23,0:25:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we acquired it, it would be useful at some point
Dialogue: 99,0:25:03.94,0:25:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for our plans that are about to commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.49,0:25:14.99,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,
